[
  {"id":"d01","text":"配送速度很快，服务也不错。","context":"虚构配送服务开放试运营","author_id":"demo-a","published_at":"2026-08-24T09:00:00+08:00","video_id":"demo-video-1","likes":18},
  {"id":"d02","text":"包装完整，我很满意。","context":"虚构配送服务开放试运营","author_id":"demo-b","published_at":"2026-08-24T09:12:00+08:00","video_id":"demo-video-1","parent_id":"d01","likes":8},
  {"id":"d03","text":"价格合理，支持继续改进。","context":"虚构配送服务开放试运营","author_id":"demo-c","published_at":"2026-08-24T10:05:00+08:00","video_id":"demo-video-1","likes":11},
  {"id":"d04","text":"客服很耐心，问题解决得及时。","context":"虚构配送服务开放试运营","author_id":"demo-d","published_at":"2026-08-24T11:05:00+08:00","video_id":"demo-video-1","parent_id":"d01","likes":7},
  {"id":"d05","text":"谢谢工作人员的帮助。","context":"虚构配送服务开放试运营","author_id":"demo-e","published_at":"2026-08-24T13:00:00+08:00","video_id":"demo-video-1","likes":3},
  {"id":"d06","text":"请问配送范围包含郊区吗？","context":"虚构配送服务开放试运营","author_id":"demo-f","published_at":"2026-08-24T14:00:00+08:00","video_id":"demo-video-1","parent_id":"d03","likes":2},
  {"id":"d07","text":"今天的订单还没送到，配送太慢了。","context":"虚构案例：部分订单延迟","author_id":"demo-b","published_at":"2026-08-25T09:00:00+08:00","video_id":"demo-video-2","likes":21},
  {"id":"d08","text":"包装已经坏了，这种质量让人失望。","context":"虚构案例：部分订单延迟","author_id":"demo-g","published_at":"2026-08-25T09:40:00+08:00","video_id":"demo-video-2","parent_id":"d07","likes":14},
  {"id":"d09","text":"配送不及时，客服也不回复。","context":"虚构案例：部分订单延迟","author_id":"demo-h","published_at":"2026-08-25T11:00:00+08:00","video_id":"demo-video-2","parent_id":"d07","likes":19},
  {"id":"d10","text":"我的订单倒是准时到了。","context":"虚构案例：部分订单延迟","author_id":"demo-a","published_at":"2026-08-25T12:00:00+08:00","video_id":"demo-video-2","likes":5},
  {"id":"d11","text":"退款进度能说明一下吗？","context":"虚构案例：部分订单延迟","author_id":"demo-i","published_at":"2026-08-25T14:00:00+08:00","video_id":"demo-video-2","parent_id":"d07","likes":8},
  {"id":"d12","text":"希望把配送延迟的原因说清楚。","context":"虚构案例：部分订单延迟","author_id":"demo-j","published_at":"2026-08-25T16:00:00+08:00","video_id":"demo-video-2","likes":12},
  {"id":"d13","text":"等了三天还没到，配送可真快啊。","context":"虚构案例：用户讨论配送延误","author_id":"demo-g","published_at":"2026-08-26T09:00:00+08:00","video_id":"demo-video-3","parent_id":"d07","likes":40},
  {"id":"d14","text":"客服一直不回复，真是太贴心了。","context":"虚构案例：用户讨论配送延误","author_id":"demo-k","published_at":"2026-08-26T10:00:00+08:00","video_id":"demo-video-3","parent_id":"d13","likes":32},
  {"id":"d15","text":"真棒，退款又让我再等一周。","context":"虚构案例：用户讨论配送延误","author_id":"demo-l","published_at":"2026-08-26T11:00:00+08:00","video_id":"demo-video-3","parent_id":"d13","likes":24},
  {"id":"d16","text":"服务差得离谱，不会再用了。","context":"虚构案例：用户讨论配送延误","author_id":"demo-h","published_at":"2026-08-26T13:00:00+08:00","video_id":"demo-video-3","parent_id":"d13","likes":18},
  {"id":"d17","text":"这不是一般的慢，蜗牛都到家了。","context":"虚构案例：用户讨论配送延误","author_id":"demo-m","published_at":"2026-08-26T15:00:00+08:00","video_id":"demo-video-3","parent_id":"d14","likes":15},
  {"id":"d18","text":"先核对订单证据，不要攻击具体的人。","context":"虚构案例：用户讨论配送延误","author_id":"demo-n","published_at":"2026-08-26T17:00:00+08:00","video_id":"demo-video-3","likes":20},
  {"id":"d19","text":"公告解释了延误原因，还需要看到后续处理。","context":"虚构案例：服务方发布情况说明","author_id":"demo-o","published_at":"2026-08-27T09:00:00+08:00","video_id":"demo-video-4","likes":34},
  {"id":"d20","text":"道歉不能代替退款。","context":"虚构案例：服务方发布情况说明","author_id":"demo-i","published_at":"2026-08-27T10:00:00+08:00","video_id":"demo-video-4","parent_id":"d19","likes":22},
  {"id":"d21","text":"处理方案比昨天清楚，希望落实。","context":"虚构案例：服务方发布情况说明","author_id":"demo-c","published_at":"2026-08-27T11:00:00+08:00","video_id":"demo-video-4","parent_id":"d19","likes":13},
  {"id":"d22","text":"不愧是你，说明写得比解决问题还快。","context":"虚构案例：服务方发布情况说明","author_id":"demo-k","published_at":"2026-08-27T13:00:00+08:00","video_id":"demo-video-4","parent_id":"d19","likes":17},
  {"id":"d23","text":"能给一个明确的退款时间吗？","context":"虚构案例：服务方发布情况说明","author_id":"demo-f","published_at":"2026-08-27T14:00:00+08:00","video_id":"demo-video-4","parent_id":"d20","likes":7},
  {"id":"d24","text":"已提交订单编号，等待客服答复。","context":"虚构案例：服务方发布情况说明","author_id":"demo-p","published_at":"2026-08-27T17:00:00+08:00","video_id":"demo-video-4","likes":2},
  {"id":"d25","text":"退款到账了，处理效率确实改善了。","context":"虚构案例：部分用户反馈退款到账","author_id":"demo-i","published_at":"2026-08-28T09:00:00+08:00","video_id":"demo-video-5","likes":28},
  {"id":"d26","text":"客服这次态度很好，谢谢。","context":"虚构案例：部分用户反馈退款到账","author_id":"demo-h","published_at":"2026-08-28T10:00:00+08:00","video_id":"demo-video-5","parent_id":"d25","likes":16},
  {"id":"d27","text":"我的还没到，不能只看已经解决的订单。","context":"虚构案例：部分用户反馈退款到账","author_id":"demo-l","published_at":"2026-08-28T11:00:00+08:00","video_id":"demo-video-5","parent_id":"d25","likes":20},
  {"id":"d28","text":"补发的包装完整了，质量还可以。","context":"虚构案例：部分用户反馈退款到账","author_id":"demo-b","published_at":"2026-08-28T12:00:00+08:00","video_id":"demo-video-5","likes":10},
  {"id":"d29","text":"希望把改进措施坚持下去。","context":"虚构案例：部分用户反馈退款到账","author_id":"demo-e","published_at":"2026-08-28T14:00:00+08:00","video_id":"demo-video-5","parent_id":"d25","likes":6},
  {"id":"d30","text":"有进展是好事，仍需持续观察。","context":"虚构案例：部分用户反馈退款到账","author_id":"demo-n","published_at":"2026-08-28T16:00:00+08:00","video_id":"demo-video-5","likes":8},
  {"id":"d31","text":"服务恢复正常，配送准时，满意。","context":"虚构案例：一周后跟进","author_id":"demo-a","published_at":"2026-08-29T09:00:00+08:00","video_id":"demo-video-6","likes":19},
  {"id":"d32","text":"客服主动跟进了我的问题，值得肯定。","context":"虚构案例：一周后跟进","author_id":"demo-d","published_at":"2026-08-29T10:00:00+08:00","video_id":"demo-video-6","parent_id":"d31","likes":13},
  {"id":"d33","text":"价格没涨，包装也改好了。","context":"虚构案例：一周后跟进","author_id":"demo-j","published_at":"2026-08-29T11:00:00+08:00","video_id":"demo-video-6","likes":10},
  {"id":"d34","text":"这次不是敷衍，退款和补偿都落实了。","context":"虚构案例：一周后跟进","author_id":"demo-g","published_at":"2026-08-29T13:00:00+08:00","video_id":"demo-video-6","parent_id":"d31","likes":15},
  {"id":"d35","text":"仍有少数订单待处理，请继续公布进度。","context":"虚构案例：一周后跟进","author_id":"demo-o","published_at":"2026-08-29T15:00:00+08:00","video_id":"demo-video-6","likes":11},
  {"id":"d36","text":"我没有用过这个服务，先了解一下。","context":"虚构案例：一周后跟进","author_id":"demo-q","published_at":"2026-08-29T16:00:00+08:00","video_id":"demo-video-6","parent_id":"d35","likes":1}
